0..76 Comment "//! Atom sorts [Pitts-2013-nominal_sets_names_symmetry_computer_science] and"
77..149 Comment "//! [Gabbay-2009-nominal_universal_algebra]. A sort classified `Atom` is"
150..229 Comment "//! orbit-infinite, with equality and swapping its only structure: an operation"
230..309 Comment "//! takes an atom, and none returns one. Each block is a value of `Theory` that"
310..389 Comment "//! keeps the atom sort as an `Atom` link of its sort chain, so a program reads"
390..412 Comment "//! it back by `case`."
413..416 Comment "//!"
417..487 Comment "//! - cites: [Pitts-2013-nominal_sets_names_symmetry_computer_science]"
488..540 Comment "//! - cites: [Gabbay-2009-nominal_universal_algebra]"
